WEBVTT

00:01.290 --> 00:08.310
<i>Can you imagine a life where you 
can't even touch the person you love?</i>

00:09.100 --> 00:14.150
<i>The curse the witch laid upon him caused 
him to take the lives of any he touched.</i>

00:14.840 --> 00:19.080
<i>His own mother distanced herself from him,
 his friends called him a monster...</i>

00:19.080 --> 00:20.460
<i>Even people he'd never met spoke of him as</i>

00:20.460 --> 00:23.490
<i>"death incarnate that dwells in the forest."</i>

00:24.370 --> 00:29.180
<i>And yet, he doesn't feel 
the least bit lonely.</i>

00:32.180 --> 00:36.970
I love boobs. All types of boobs.

00:36.970 --> 00:39.140
But what is it about thighs you like?

00:41.220 --> 00:42.900
What's it to you?

00:42.900 --> 00:45.600
And it's rude to women to 
discuss things like that.

00:45.930 --> 00:48.060
B-But if you insist...

00:48.060 --> 00:53.130
If the world ever ends, I want to meet 
my death with my head on Alice's thighs.

00:54.000 --> 00:56.060
Obviously this assumes the curse is broken.

00:56.060 --> 00:58.290
What's your favorite part of a girl, Rob?

00:58.290 --> 01:00.320
Well...

01:00.320 --> 01:02.950
I love their smiles.

01:03.610 --> 01:05.020
That's not fair.

01:05.020 --> 01:06.440
That's not fair at all, Rob!

02:38.010 --> 02:41.720
Episode 22
The Duke, Alice, and the Flying Broom

02:42.620 --> 02:45.430
It's easy to see the pictures 
when the book's this big!

02:50.110 --> 02:52.970
There's nobody around, so it's okay, right?

02:55.510 --> 02:56.330
A witch?

02:56.330 --> 02:57.690
Wait, no, Alice!

02:58.210 --> 02:59.600
Why are you coming in through the window?

02:59.600 --> 03:00.910
This is the third floor!

03:00.910 --> 03:04.220
Your Grace, were you looking 
at something naughty?

03:04.220 --> 03:05.690
I d-don't know what you're talking about.

03:05.690 --> 03:08.120
I could see what you were up to, Your Grace.

03:08.910 --> 03:11.400
I'm sorry to startle you.

03:11.400 --> 03:15.090
Everything you do makes my heart race.

03:15.470 --> 03:18.870
I wanted to see your cute face...

03:19.290 --> 03:21.550
So how'd you get in from 
the 3rd floor window?

03:22.030 --> 03:23.500
Ta-dah!

03:23.500 --> 03:25.260
I used a flying broom.

03:25.560 --> 03:28.220
It just looks like a normal broom to me.

03:29.240 --> 03:31.530
Keto gave it to me.

03:32.410 --> 03:33.810
Watch.

03:35.700 --> 03:36.570
It floats!

03:36.800 --> 03:40.580
There's a trick to it, but once you 
get the hang of it, it's a lot of fun.

03:41.610 --> 03:42.570
That's great.

03:42.570 --> 03:44.160
I want to try it, too.

03:44.160 --> 03:45.240
Go ahead.

03:45.240 --> 03:46.610
You want me to ride with you?

03:51.820 --> 03:52.720
It's floating!

03:52.720 --> 03:54.530
Let's go out to the hallway.

04:03.830 --> 04:06.370
<i>Alice's hair smells so good.</i>

04:08.720 --> 04:10.030
Hey, Rob.

04:10.810 --> 04:12.810
A broom for two! How romantic!

04:12.810 --> 04:13.440
For real?

04:13.910 --> 04:15.150
They're flying?

04:15.530 --> 04:17.210
Took you long enough!

04:17.870 --> 04:19.470
Take care!

04:20.230 --> 04:21.720
A broom for two!

04:21.720 --> 04:23.550
That sounds so nice.

04:23.550 --> 04:25.070
I'm turning right.

04:26.310 --> 04:27.690
I'm accelerating.

04:29.380 --> 04:31.500
Magic is incredible!

04:31.500 --> 04:32.160
Yes.

04:32.160 --> 04:33.750
It's a lot of fun if you can use it.

04:34.460 --> 04:36.460
<i>My sister was a magical genius.</i>

04:39.460 --> 04:41.530
<i>But Sade died.</i>

04:41.900 --> 04:43.920
<i>And even Daleth doesn't know why.</i>

04:44.770 --> 04:48.040
<i>If she was alive, she might've broken my curse.</i>

04:48.040 --> 04:49.560
<i>We might've been able to talk.</i>

04:49.560 --> 04:52.680
<i>But did she curse Sharon and me?</i>

04:53.270 --> 04:56.300
Is something wrong, Your Grace?

04:56.300 --> 05:01.920
O-Oh, you saw me looking at that 
naughty picture. I'm just kind of embarrassed.

05:01.920 --> 05:03.110
Oh, is that all?

05:03.470 --> 05:06.820
If you like, I'll show you something 
naughty any time you want.

05:08.600 --> 05:09.910
Oh, my.

05:11.340 --> 05:14.220
The two of you don't come 
together that often.

05:14.220 --> 05:16.650
You've got a lot of stuff with you, too.

05:16.650 --> 05:18.960
Did you get fired from the circus?

05:18.960 --> 05:20.840
Nope. Ringmaster's orders.

05:21.430 --> 05:23.490
Let us live here for a while.

05:24.420 --> 05:29.040
Some weirdos came to the 
circus looking for me.

05:29.530 --> 05:32.780
A kid and an old lady, supposedly.

05:32.780 --> 05:37.800
Hugo says they beat up a bunch of 
the town brats almost instantly.

05:37.800 --> 05:39.250
Who are they?

05:39.250 --> 05:40.370
I don't know.

05:40.370 --> 05:43.650
Somebody who wants me to use 
my time magic, I assume.

05:44.160 --> 05:47.610
Given what Daleth's been up to, 
they're probably not witches.

05:48.200 --> 05:51.580
Anyway, I got some time off.

05:51.580 --> 05:53.430
So let me enjoy it, please.

05:53.430 --> 05:55.150
Is it a bother?

05:55.150 --> 05:56.050
Not at all.

05:56.050 --> 05:57.390
We're glad to have you!

05:57.390 --> 05:58.640
Yay!

05:58.640 --> 06:00.320
I get to sleep over with Alice!

06:00.320 --> 06:02.130
How exciting!

06:03.210 --> 06:05.090
We can have a pillow fight tonight!

06:05.090 --> 06:08.050
It looked like you just did.

06:08.050 --> 06:10.060
The person who has the most fun wins!

06:10.060 --> 06:12.100
Then you win already!

06:12.100 --> 06:14.390
Let's do strip rock-paper-scissors 
or the King's Game!

06:14.390 --> 06:16.100
Is your mind made of steel?

06:16.100 --> 06:18.710
Oh, a pillow fight sounds fun!

06:18.710 --> 06:20.600
Rob, think about your back!

06:21.290 --> 06:23.220
It'll be fun to have them around.

06:23.220 --> 06:24.570
Right, Alice?

06:24.570 --> 06:26.230
I was just thinking the same thing!

06:26.230 --> 06:27.490
Pervert noble.

06:27.960 --> 06:32.000
Since you're guests, you can relax.

06:32.000 --> 06:32.990
No way!

06:33.800 --> 06:36.440
You're letting us stay here, so we'll work!

06:36.440 --> 06:38.460
She's such a good girl!

06:39.050 --> 06:40.070
Let's go, Alice!

06:40.070 --> 06:42.390
I can do anything but cleaning, 
cooking, and washing!

06:42.760 --> 06:43.960
All right.

06:44.390 --> 06:47.190
I have a maid outfit that might suit you.

06:47.190 --> 06:48.650
Will you try it on?

06:48.650 --> 06:49.720
Please!

06:49.720 --> 06:51.110
Me too, then!

06:51.110 --> 06:53.300
Don't try to get between them!

06:54.260 --> 06:56.080
They have a lot of stuff to talk about.

06:56.080 --> 06:58.770
Like what happened at the Sabbath and Daleth.

06:59.310 --> 07:01.170
How far have you gone with Alice?

07:01.170 --> 07:02.520
I said talk about the Sabbath!

07:04.270 --> 07:05.550
What do you think?

07:05.550 --> 07:08.110
This is strong! I'm invincible now!

07:09.080 --> 07:10.950
You're so cute!

07:12.660 --> 07:14.940
Okay, time to get to work!

07:14.940 --> 07:17.620
I'll start by warming up the mansion!

07:17.960 --> 07:20.080
Here I go!

07:22.160 --> 07:24.100
Looks like this is the spot.

07:24.100 --> 07:24.910
Yeah.

07:24.910 --> 07:25.790
There's a witch here.

07:26.470 --> 07:28.760
Okay, you can have this back.

07:29.290 --> 07:30.760
The logbook from the family home...

07:30.760 --> 07:31.550
Thank you.

07:31.550 --> 07:33.020
You really were able to bring it back.

07:33.020 --> 07:34.410
Your magic's incredible.

07:34.410 --> 07:35.970
I kept my promise, okay?

07:36.460 --> 07:38.900
<i>Even though I forgot about 
it till Daleth reminded me.</i>

07:39.320 --> 07:43.250
There's something Daleth 
wanted to hide in here.

07:43.250 --> 07:46.140
Yeah, something about Sade.

07:46.740 --> 07:50.440
I hope it's a hint to breaking 
Sharon's and my curse...

07:50.720 --> 07:55.340
So Alice's mom is asleep, right? But is she hot?

07:55.960 --> 07:56.800
Not telling.

07:56.800 --> 07:57.970
Why?

07:57.970 --> 08:00.050
I like older women, too.

08:00.050 --> 08:01.760
And that's why!

08:02.410 --> 08:03.540
Here it is.

08:03.540 --> 08:04.500
What does it say?

08:04.950 --> 08:07.780
The Master got a visit from 
the nuns, Sade and Daleth.

08:07.780 --> 08:10.370
This hasn't happened for a while.

08:10.370 --> 08:11.800
Huh. Is this all?

08:11.800 --> 08:14.970
Cuff can't read, but you can, huh?

08:14.970 --> 08:16.180
I guess.

08:16.180 --> 08:18.190
You're pretty smart for a witch.

08:18.800 --> 08:20.300
No, it wasn't me who said that!

08:20.300 --> 08:21.280
Up here.

08:22.330 --> 08:25.190
Hello. You're Death Incarnate, then?

08:28.320 --> 08:30.810
Sorry to interrupt your cleaning.

08:32.400 --> 08:35.800
But it's easier to wipe 
down if it's wet, right?

08:35.800 --> 08:37.370
Who are you?

08:40.660 --> 08:43.480
So the time witch is with you, too?

08:43.480 --> 08:46.070
We were right to try the circus.

08:46.070 --> 08:47.600
It worked out just like I thought.

08:47.600 --> 08:48.450
What?

08:48.450 --> 08:50.300
Time to start by...

08:50.970 --> 08:53.300
No! If you touch me, you'll die!

08:55.770 --> 08:57.760
I guess even Death Incarnate can't do it.

08:57.760 --> 09:00.990
Wh-Why? I know you touched me...

09:00.990 --> 09:04.100
I can feel magic from him...

09:05.080 --> 09:06.560
But you're no witch!

09:09.620 --> 09:12.480
Make sure you don't slip, old lady.

09:12.780 --> 09:14.950
<i>Even at a time like this, she's kind.</i>

09:15.860 --> 09:17.260
Who are you?

09:17.260 --> 09:18.330
Why are you here?

09:18.330 --> 09:20.660
You never shut up, do you?

09:25.740 --> 09:28.340
I can't... move.

09:29.130 --> 09:31.770
They must be wizards, then.

09:31.770 --> 09:32.840
Wizards?

09:33.130 --> 09:37.300
Yeah. Humans born with magic.

09:37.300 --> 09:39.090
This kid's probably...

09:39.090 --> 09:43.020
Kid? I'm older than you.

09:47.270 --> 09:49.730
Are you okay, thigh noble?

09:49.730 --> 09:52.190
Don't call me that!

09:55.830 --> 09:59.170
You do stink. Like a witch.

10:00.370 --> 10:01.730
Listen well.

10:01.730 --> 10:03.330
My name is Ichi.

10:03.630 --> 10:06.040
Do something, Zain!

10:06.270 --> 10:08.500
I can't do anything!

10:12.880 --> 10:14.670
Sorry for getting rough.

10:14.910 --> 10:16.690
My name is Nico.

10:16.690 --> 10:20.390
I'm a wizard. A human born 
with magic, like you said.

10:20.760 --> 10:22.640
And what do you want?

10:22.640 --> 10:24.540
Don't be so cross.

10:24.540 --> 10:28.100
I want your help with something.

10:28.360 --> 10:31.150
Help? No way!

10:31.150 --> 10:33.820
I can't trust someone who just 
barges in and attacks us!

10:33.820 --> 10:34.820
Wait!

10:35.480 --> 10:36.860
Let's talk to him.

10:36.860 --> 10:40.780
He survived touching me.

10:42.030 --> 10:44.030
I'm glad you understand.

10:49.390 --> 10:52.520
You say you have an immortality curse?

10:52.520 --> 10:54.500
Yeah. I proved it, right?

10:55.020 --> 10:58.720
I heard you kill anything 
you touch, so I tried it.

10:59.220 --> 11:01.770
But I guess my curse is stronger.

11:02.520 --> 11:04.430
Did Sade curse you, too?

11:04.790 --> 11:05.620
Yeah.

11:05.620 --> 11:07.290
But I can't break it...

11:07.290 --> 11:09.140
Even though I killed her!

11:09.450 --> 11:10.850
You killed Sade?

11:10.850 --> 11:12.980
Haha! Look at this loser brag!

11:12.980 --> 11:16.140
"My curse is stronger!" "I killed Sade!"

11:16.140 --> 11:17.610
I'm telling the truth!

11:17.610 --> 11:20.070
Respect your elders.

11:20.960 --> 11:22.440
You're too close.

11:22.440 --> 11:24.640
I don't care if you're a wizard or what.

11:24.640 --> 11:26.450
I'll protect Alice.

11:26.450 --> 11:27.450
Come and get me!

11:29.020 --> 11:30.210
A long time ago,

11:30.870 --> 11:35.670
fifty or so of us wizards lived 
quietly in a small village.

11:37.350 --> 11:41.130
We kept our distance from 
witches and normal humans.

11:41.830 --> 11:45.850
But when I was an old man, 
Sade suddenly appeared before me.

11:46.660 --> 11:51.260
She said that humanity had 
no business using magic.

11:51.260 --> 11:55.620
She turned me into a child and 
placed this immortality curse on me.

11:56.140 --> 11:59.850
We decided to watch her.

12:00.550 --> 12:03.320
And the more we did, 
the more dangerous she looked.

12:04.820 --> 12:08.790
My friends told me how you were 
cursed when you were little.

12:09.380 --> 12:12.750
Something had to be done about Sade.

12:15.280 --> 12:17.880
So we prepared as best we could,

12:18.550 --> 12:20.870
and set out to kill her.

12:21.770 --> 12:23.720
She was strong.

12:24.480 --> 12:26.640
None of our preparations helped.

12:26.640 --> 12:28.940
No matter what we did, 
she seemed to know in advance.

12:28.940 --> 12:31.190
She used one powerful spell after another.

12:35.080 --> 12:37.130
In the end...

12:39.130 --> 12:41.050
We won through sheer numbers.

12:41.870 --> 12:44.900
Dozens of my comrades lost their lives,

12:44.900 --> 12:46.820
but we defeated her.

12:49.510 --> 12:53.490
Ironically, it was her 
curse that kept me alive.

12:55.250 --> 12:56.510
Seriously?

12:56.510 --> 12:57.270
Yes.

12:57.270 --> 13:00.020
It was the only way to stop her.

13:00.680 --> 13:01.540
Whatever.

13:01.540 --> 13:04.970
So what do you want our help with?

13:04.970 --> 13:10.760
I want to use your time magic 
to go back before I was cursed...

13:11.670 --> 13:14.190
and kill Sade again.

13:16.170 --> 13:17.230
<i>Kill her?</i>

13:18.160 --> 13:19.270
<i>Kill her?</i>

13:20.290 --> 13:21.320
<i>Kill her?</i>

13:22.280 --> 13:23.360
<i>Kill her?</i>

13:24.530 --> 13:25.600
<i>Kill her?</i>

13:29.430 --> 13:34.080
The only way to be sure to break the curse 
is to kill her before it's even placed.

13:34.720 --> 13:37.740
I've gathered my comrades. 
We're getting ready.

13:37.740 --> 13:38.570
How about it?

13:38.570 --> 13:40.460
It's a rather selfish plan.

13:40.460 --> 13:42.300
You can't do it without my magic, right?

13:43.100 --> 13:45.590
And that's why we came to find you.

13:45.590 --> 13:48.170
We can break his curse and mine.

13:48.170 --> 13:49.760
Two birds with one stone, right?

13:49.760 --> 13:51.450
No way.

13:51.450 --> 13:54.020
I only care about breaking my buddy's curse.

13:54.420 --> 13:56.620
I've got no reason to help you.

13:59.090 --> 14:00.890
Sade's strong.

14:00.890 --> 14:04.570
Objectively speaking, it's impossible 
for you to beat her alone.

14:07.570 --> 14:10.290
I've done my research.

14:10.290 --> 14:14.110
Zain, you have talent, but you
 don't know how to use it.

14:14.110 --> 14:15.740
You can't bring out your full potential.

14:15.740 --> 14:16.870
What?

14:16.870 --> 14:18.550
You know this too, right?

14:18.550 --> 14:20.580
There's a lot of waste in your magic.

14:21.090 --> 14:23.440
You just make up for it 
with your immense power.

14:24.000 --> 14:28.670
And you need to focus a lot 
to use your time magic, too.

14:29.930 --> 14:35.020
But if you study at our 
wizardry school, you'll get better.

14:35.370 --> 14:36.750
Wizardry school?

14:36.750 --> 14:37.490
Yes.

14:37.490 --> 14:38.730
Of course, you're welcome, too.

14:39.130 --> 14:41.850
You can learn to use a 
magic weapon, at least.

14:42.440 --> 14:43.910
No way!

14:43.910 --> 14:46.650
A witch can't learn magic from a human!

14:46.650 --> 14:49.200
I'm not working with you! Ever!

14:49.440 --> 14:51.910
It's a co-ed school.

14:52.320 --> 14:53.760
I brought a girl with me.

14:53.760 --> 14:54.800
Want me to introduce you?

14:54.800 --> 14:55.660
Seriously?

14:56.850 --> 14:58.280
Why?

14:58.280 --> 15:00.870
Why am I so weak to your magic?

15:00.870 --> 15:02.790
You're so stupid, girl.

15:02.790 --> 15:05.850
It's because water beats fire.

15:05.850 --> 15:06.740
I refuse to accept this!

15:06.740 --> 15:07.590
Once more!

15:07.590 --> 15:10.450
Cuff, you shouldn't force 
yourself to fight.

15:10.450 --> 15:11.610
I'm sorry, Alice.

15:11.610 --> 15:13.440
I'm so weak...

15:13.440 --> 15:16.350
I can't protect anyone like this.

15:17.370 --> 15:21.210
I went too far. I just wanted 
to test your strength.

15:21.210 --> 15:23.440
I'm sorry for starting a fight.

15:25.620 --> 15:28.360
Do you want to be stronger?

15:28.760 --> 15:29.570
I do!

15:32.730 --> 15:34.300
Come to our school,

15:34.300 --> 15:35.650
and I'll make sure you get stronger.

15:35.650 --> 15:36.730
School?

15:36.730 --> 15:37.490
Ichi!

15:38.330 --> 15:40.370
Huh? Where's the girl?

15:40.970 --> 15:43.930
Ooh, nice and naughty!

15:46.060 --> 15:48.130
Sorry. I was joking.

15:50.030 --> 15:51.090
I'll introduce you.

15:51.660 --> 15:54.430
This is Ichi, my lover.

15:58.350 --> 16:00.150
You tricked me!

16:00.150 --> 16:02.620
That's no girl!

16:02.620 --> 16:04.310
She's beautiful!

16:04.560 --> 16:05.830
Like hell she is!

16:05.830 --> 16:08.110
I wanted to see a girl!

16:08.110 --> 16:09.030
A girl!

16:09.030 --> 16:10.030
Girl!

16:10.030 --> 16:13.240
Every woman is a girl at heart, fool!

16:13.720 --> 16:15.640
Are you two okay?

16:15.640 --> 16:17.450
We just got splashed with water.

16:17.450 --> 16:19.410
It'll dry quick.

16:20.410 --> 16:22.250
Oh, damn it!

16:22.250 --> 16:25.280
You lied to me about there being a girl here!

16:25.280 --> 16:28.500
And you were mean to my Cuff, too!

16:28.500 --> 16:30.880
I was not.

16:30.880 --> 16:32.250
Zain, it's okay.

16:32.250 --> 16:33.860
Listen to me.

16:33.860 --> 16:35.420
I'm not lying.

16:35.420 --> 16:38.100
There are female students at our school.

16:38.100 --> 16:40.140
And they're all old ladies, right?

16:40.140 --> 16:42.310
Zain, just listen to me!

16:43.090 --> 16:44.600
No fighting!

16:45.600 --> 16:47.770
We'll be going.

16:49.790 --> 16:52.800
I'm sure you'll come to the wizardry school.

16:53.960 --> 16:57.550
I didn't say I was coming here.
 I wonder if Flea's mad.

17:03.370 --> 17:06.500
I'm happy you chose to rely on me, Flea!

17:06.500 --> 17:08.460
Brother Nico, Sister Ichi!

17:08.460 --> 17:10.490
Another weirdo!

17:10.490 --> 17:12.670
He seems like he was in a hurry.

17:13.650 --> 17:15.840
Brother Nico, I've prepared a carriage!

17:16.500 --> 17:17.530
Get aboard!

17:22.010 --> 17:23.680
He transformed!

17:24.490 --> 17:26.710
I know how hard it is to be cursed.

17:26.710 --> 17:29.660
Let's beat Sade and break the curse.

17:31.100 --> 17:32.630
I'll see you at school.

17:32.630 --> 17:34.070
Invite a girl you like.

17:35.080 --> 17:36.280
Wait!

17:36.570 --> 17:38.180
I want to talk to you!

17:38.780 --> 17:39.870
Your Grace!

17:50.200 --> 17:51.960
What? You still want to talk?

17:51.960 --> 17:55.920
I want to ask if we really have to kill Sade!

17:55.920 --> 17:57.160
Of course.

17:57.160 --> 17:58.640
She's too dangerous.

17:58.890 --> 18:01.000
You did all this just to ask that?

18:01.000 --> 18:02.600
Shut the door. I'm cold.

18:03.050 --> 18:06.930
If we can go back into the past with 
Zain's magic, we can change things!

18:07.360 --> 18:12.360
We can talk to her first and 
find out why she cursed us!

18:12.670 --> 18:14.590
I've been thinking...

18:14.590 --> 18:19.610
The last thing we'll need to kill 
Sade is for you to touch her.

18:22.950 --> 18:27.110
Not that I know if her own 
curse will work on her.

18:27.480 --> 18:30.820
But if nothing else, her magic didn't kill me.

18:31.180 --> 18:32.540
So it's worth trying.

18:32.540 --> 18:33.000
No!

18:33.250 --> 18:34.670
I don't want to do that!

18:34.670 --> 18:35.890
No! No!

18:35.890 --> 18:37.970
I don't want to kill anyone!

18:39.290 --> 18:42.430
Yes, her curse has caused me a lot of misery!

18:43.720 --> 18:45.930
It changed Rob's life.

18:46.760 --> 18:48.580
And I can't touch Alice!

18:49.420 --> 18:51.540
I can't dance or go on dates...

18:51.540 --> 18:52.900
Fine, fine...

18:52.900 --> 18:57.750
But it shouldn't be that 
easy to just take a life!

18:57.750 --> 19:00.350
I don't want to kill her just 
because she's an evil witch!

19:00.350 --> 19:02.810
I don't want to be afraid. 
I want to accept her!

19:02.810 --> 19:04.080
I'm going to be

19:06.060 --> 19:07.790
friends with Sade!

19:10.010 --> 19:12.120
I forgot to give you this.

19:12.120 --> 19:15.570
It's a school brochure and your uniforms.

19:25.380 --> 19:27.160
Be friends with her, huh?

19:27.470 --> 19:30.860
What's his plan? Start with
 formal introductions?

19:30.860 --> 19:32.190
Maybe be pen pals?

19:32.190 --> 19:33.360
I don't know.

19:33.360 --> 19:36.760
Anyway, go back to your usual form.

19:36.760 --> 19:38.660
It's like I'm in love with a little kid,

19:38.660 --> 19:39.740
and I don't like it.

19:39.740 --> 19:41.110
Just a little more.

19:47.780 --> 19:49.620
Huh? You're leaving?

19:49.930 --> 19:52.330
There's no need to hide anymore,

19:52.330 --> 19:56.090
and Cuff says she wants 
to go to their school.

19:56.090 --> 19:57.870
We need to get ready for that.

19:57.870 --> 19:59.550
So you're going too, then.

19:59.550 --> 20:02.230
Yeah. It's supposed to be co-ed.

20:03.760 --> 20:05.300
Cuff, you seem down.

20:05.300 --> 20:07.560
Can I touch your boobs to cheer you up?

20:10.850 --> 20:12.120
Bye!

20:12.120 --> 20:13.040
We'll be back.

20:16.150 --> 20:17.400
I want to be stronger.

20:21.450 --> 20:23.540
Strong enough to protect everyone.

21:55.010 --> 21:57.950
A lot more people come here lately.

21:57.950 --> 22:00.190
The two today surprised me, though.

22:00.190 --> 22:00.860
Yes.

22:00.860 --> 22:02.720
You made more friends.

22:02.720 --> 22:04.010
Friends, huh?

22:04.010 --> 22:07.730
Well, they're not bad people.

22:07.730 --> 22:10.480
I have to be glad that we're 
not alone all the time.

22:10.480 --> 22:14.020
Cuff and Zain are nice enough 
to come visit someone like me.

22:14.020 --> 22:18.110
That part of you must be 
what everyone respects.

22:18.110 --> 22:19.330
Y-Yeah?

22:19.330 --> 22:22.590
Yes, of course. I respect you a lot, too.

22:22.590 --> 22:25.990
Aw, that's so sweet and cute.

22:25.080 --> 22:28.850
But right now, I've got you all to myself.

22:30.700 --> 22:32.880
The moon's so huge, Alice!

22:32.880 --> 22:33.910
Let's go look!

22:40.240 --> 22:40.930
Alice...

22:41.430 --> 22:44.020
<i>She's so sexy when she's just 
getting out of a window.</i>

22:44.020 --> 22:45.900
I put my leg out deliberately.

22:45.900 --> 22:46.590
I'm sure you did!

22:49.450 --> 22:51.720
It gets chilly at night.

22:51.720 --> 22:53.090
Shall we strip and warm each other up—

22:53.090 --> 22:54.570
No! Keep your clothes on!

22:57.110 --> 23:00.350
Alice, don't worry.

23:00.350 --> 23:02.020
Everything I have is yours.

23:04.540 --> 23:07.390
<i>Why did I say I had him all to myself?</i>

23:07.960 --> 23:10.910
<i>I'm happy that he has more friends...</i>

23:12.100 --> 23:16.600
<i>But I want him more than ever.</i>

23:19.320 --> 23:22.260
Is it time for the pillow fight?

23:22.260 --> 23:26.050
I've brought two of my own pillows!

23:31.260 --> 23:33.950
I'm too late.

23:35.010 --> 23:40.250
The Duke of Death and His Maid
The Duke, Alice, and the Wizardry School

23:35.690 --> 23:39.480
"The Duke, Alice, and the Wizardry School."
